      "slug": "tomato-basil-pasta",
      "title": "Tomato Basil Pasta",
      "tagline": "A 30-minute weeknight pasta built on a fresh tomato sauce.",
      "description": "Ripe tomatoes cooked down with garlic and olive oil until they collapse into a sauce, finished with torn basil and starchy pasta water. One pan, one pot, no specialty shopping.",
      "category": "mains",
