      "tagline": "A one-pot chicken curry with a spice base you can adjust to taste.",
      "description": "Onions cooked down until golden, bloomed with curry powder and ginger, then simmered with chicken thighs in coconut milk until the sauce clings. Mild for family dinners, hot if you want it.",
