        },
        {
          "text": "Make small wells in the sauce with a spoon and crack an egg into each one.",
          "timerMinutes": null,
          "tip": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Cover and cook over low heat until the whites are set but the yolks are still soft.",
          "timerMinutes": 6,
